  "description": {
   "en": "In order to be resurrected, Sheng Nuan needs to travel through time and space to become a cannon fodder in different worlds and complete the task of stopping the villains from turning evil. However... these cold-blooded, paranoid villains, why are they all suddenly saying things like: \"Nuan Nuan, you are not allowed to go anywhere except by my side...\" \"Nuan Nuan, for you, what does it matter if I destroy the country!\" \"Nuan Nuan, you are my inner demon.\" Sheng Nuan:???"
